      <Desc>HAPPY MAMA: HAPPY MAMA IS A FULL-SPECTRUM COMMUNITY BASED DOULA PRACTICE DEDICATED TO COMPREHENSIVE MATERNITY SUPPORT. WE PROVIDE PERSONALIZED PROGRAMS, EDUCATION, GUIDANCE, COACHING, AND ADVOCACY, ADDRESSING PHYSICAL, MENTAL, EMOTIONAL, HOLISTIC, SOCIAL, AND ECONOMIC ASPECTS OF MATERNAL CARE FROM PRECONCEPTION TO 12 MONTHS POSTPARTUM. ALONGSIDE ONE ON ONE AND GROUP SUPPORT SERVICES, OUR DIGITAL PLATFORM EXTENDS ACCESS TO COACHES, SPECIALISTS, COMMUNITY RESOURCES, PEER GROUPS, AND A VARIETY OF LIVE AND PRE-RECORDED PROGRAMS. IT ALSO FEATURES PRODUCTS AND SERVICES AT SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCED COSTS, ENSURING EVERY WOMEAN RECEIVES THE SUPPORT SHE NEEDS AT EVERY STAGE OF HER JOURNEY. IN 2024 THIS PROGRAM HELPED MORE THAN 2,500 FAMILIES.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
